# Dustwallow Marsh (37-38): the Horde quests of Brackenwall Village, the Shady Rest Inn and Swamplight
# Manor, and Apothecary Zinge's errands in Undercity, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/dustwallow_marsh_37_38.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Dustwallow Marsh, area 15).
# The quest list is section 17 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md; the later Dustwallow quests
# (Brackenwall's ogres and the Wyrmbog) are in Dustwallow Marsh (43-44).
# Left out:
#   Into The Scarlet Monastery (1048): its four bosses are inside the Scarlet Monastery, a dungeon.
#   Jarl Needs a Blade (81570): the other version of 1203 (they exclude each other and share one
#   completion flag); it wants item 217281, which is not in the realm's item data, and it has never
#   been seen in the game. The guide does 1203, the one seen in the game.
# Left to later guides: The Troll Witchdoctor (1240) and Stinky's Escape (1270), handed in by
#   Stranglethorn Vale & Swamp of Sorrows (41-43); The Black Shield (1276), handed in by Badlands
#   (39-40); Into the Field (243), handed in by Tanaris (43-43).
# Bought, not farmed: the Moonsteel Broadsword for Jarl (a blacksmith's craft, nothing drops it) at the
#   Orgrimmar auction house, and the Soothing Spices from a cooking supplier in Orgrimmar (no Horde
#   vendor in the marsh sells them).
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house, the spices); a flight to Camp Taurajo and the road east to
# the burned Shady Rest Inn; north past Mudcrush to Brackenwall Village; a loop east (Ogron and
# Reethe, the Theramore spies, Stinky, Jarl at Swamplight Manor, the Mirefin murlocs) and back by
# the Darkmist cave; Brackenwall; a second loop east (Jarl again, the Theramore docks) and back by
# the road past Mudcrush; a flight to Orgrimmar and the zeppelin to Undercity for Zinge's errands,
# where the next guide starts.

guide Dustwallow Marsh (37-38)
faction horde
levels 37 38
carry 1712 95141
leave 243 1240 1270 1276 1712 95141
next Alterac Mountains & Arathi Highlands (38-39)

# Orgrimmar ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Durotar
note "From Stranglethorn Vale, take the zeppelin from Grom'gol to the tower outside Orgrimmar, then walk into the city" at 50.8,13.4
tip Came by boat to Ratchet instead? Fly from Ratchet to Orgrimmar: the sword and the spices for Jarl are here.
map Orgrimmar
ah 1203.1 npc 8673
tip "Swamp Eye" Jarl in the marsh wants a Moonsteel Broadsword. Nothing drops it: buy one each here, or have a blacksmith make it.
note "Buy 3 Soothing Spices each from Xen'to, the cooking supplier, for Jarl" npc 3400
tip Keep the spices: no Horde vendor in Dustwallow Marsh sells them.
fly "Camp Taurajo, The Barrens" npc 3310
tip Already have the flight path to Brackenwall Village? Fly there instead, and take the Shady Rest Inn on your first ride south.

# The Shady Rest Inn ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Dustwallow Marsh
goto "Ride east from Camp Taurajo on the road into Dustwallow Marsh, to the burned Shady Rest Inn" at 29.7,47.6 r 25
accept 1268
tip Hoofprints, badge and shield are all on the ground at the inn, a few steps apart.
accept 1269
tip The badge is tiny: look closely.
accept 1251

# Brackenwall Village --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

accept 1177
tip Mudcrush Durtfeet, an ogre, stands by the way north to Brackenwall.
fpath 11899
accept 1201
turnin 1268 1269 1251
accept 1321
turnin 1321
accept 1322

# East: Ogron and Reethe, the spies, Stinky, Jarl and the Mirefin murlocs ---------------------------

do 1322 bg
tip Every Darkfang spider of the marsh can drop the venom sacs: kill those on your way all through this loop. The Lurkers are stealthed.
do 1201 bg
tip The Theramore Infiltrators are stealthed too: watch for the shimmer around Brackenwall.
accept 1273
tip Ogron leads you to Reethe and they talk; then a group attacks. Let Ogron take some of the hits, but keep him alive.
do 1273 at 42.6,38.1
do 1201
tip Most of the spies lurk northeast of Brackenwall.
accept 1270
tip Clear the raptors around Stinky first. If he is not there, someone is escorting him: wait for him.
do 1270 at 48.9,24.6
tip Follow Stinky south to the bogbean leaves and keep the raptors off him.
accept 1218
do 1218 at 55.4,26.3
turnin 1218
accept 1206
tip Jarl lives alone in Swamplight Manor, a ruined house.
accept 1238
tip The Loose Dirt is a small mound of earth just north of Jarl's house.
do 1177 at 56.9,15.7
tip The Mirefin murlocs crowd the shore north and northeast of Swamplight Manor.
do 1206
tip The Darkmist spiders live in and around the Darkmist Cavern, northwest of Brackenwall. Each of you needs 40 eyes.
do 1322 at 39.6,26.3

# Brackenwall Village --------------------------------------------------------------------------------

goto "Ride back to Brackenwall Village" at 36.0,31.0 r 25
turnin 1201
accept 1202
turnin 1238
turnin 1322
accept 1323
turnin 1323
turnin 1273
accept 1276
tip The next Black Shield goes to Thunder Bluff: keep it, the Badlands guide hands it in.

# East again: Jarl and the Theramore docks ---------------------------------------------------------

turnin 1206
accept 1203
do 1203 at 55.4,26.3
turnin 1203
accept 1239
tip Dig in the Loose Dirt again.
do 1202
tip The footlocker lies underwater beside the docks of Theramore. Swim in from the sea and keep clear of the guards on the piers.
goto "Ride back west on the road toward the Shady Rest Inn, then north" at 35.1,38.3 r 25
turnin 1177

# Brackenwall Village ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

turnin 1202
turnin 1239
accept 1240
tip Nazeer sends the head to a witchdoctor in Stranglethorn Vale: keep it, a later guide hands it in.
grind 38 at 32.7,22.0
tip Zinge in Undercity will only talk to you at level 38. Still short? The Darkmist spiders by their cavern northwest of Brackenwall are the closest good hunting.

# Orgrimmar and Undercity ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

fly "Orgrimmar, Durotar" npc 11899
map Orgrimmar
train 3352 3344
tip Hunters and shamans train here: Undercity has no trainer for them. Everyone else trains in Undercity at the start of the next guide.
map Durotar
note "Take the zeppelin from the tower outside Orgrimmar to Tirisfal Glades, then walk into Undercity" at 50.8,13.4
map Undercity
accept 232
tip Apothecary Zinge works in the Apothecarium.
turnin 232
accept 238
turnin 238
accept 243
tip Zinge sends you to Gadgetzan: keep the kit, a later guide takes it there.
